025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 5 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 38 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 that same pair ran 49% of normal on the middle of the grids, and September to October ran 37%. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 189% of normal. All 5 grids had their driest year in 1954, with grid 14890 at 54%.</p>"}
